{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_02_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1323f1ce4bf72484ae348d12823a4f1156f7601ac42d40f28f203bdb24d9042f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f249c83fb5064b3db3ca648b19787e0e1ecbb6ac5d0fac64357576b723b47f9",
      "text": "正当我在大学这片陆地上，\n快要溺水之时……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5094b2dcb0d211d4a52b49eb77673772931280108aa984c218842adff28a492a",
      "text": "没想到，竟然能遇上这样的机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4812bb57176b68ff71ac9261ccf2964f32050c8e7028e6a25f7197bf24d9b7c",
      "text": "（说实话，虽然我并不明白\n偶像究竟是怎样的事物）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82bfd9b937345031a8412c112b5232351231dff9c183d5552d000bf29313d90d",
      "text": "（但跳入未知世界的乐趣，\n我想自己比谁都清楚。……而且）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d023df6a9840d8624cc3bdb21f650cd09865274231feaeee4caddf2a034c8231",
      "text": "（我的心，已经为了这份新的发现而欢腾雀跃了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95b0502913b981bbceffb5598b5c4236f9f062bc75850fbda4faf73f9ce202bb",
      "text": "最重要的是，学生们的那个眼神。\n那正是我一直在寻觅的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27e7ebb2ae3b67bfc309e44d99728e6f902c29ce7cfbd322e0080c9301dbfff9",
      "text": "成为偶像的话，一定能让大家对我、\n对我所说的话产生兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de1b71e4822878c4f622c2fc8c29e810c5ad40aeffdfc0e0e11d05d9bf9beaf0",
      "text": "就能将大海的魅力，传达给更多的人……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9bf5bd181abe69829dc9fd801ff6643a2e59eba438791b4ef7c788754eef61e",
      "text": "可不能再这样呆坐下去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f392afb7960e126f8d93a7ae1c13ba1c503a6e18c999461269c3e7a1c83bb2c2",
      "text": "来吧，向着名为偶像的大海起航吧。\n崭新的冒险，正在等待着我！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
